Function: htmlParseTryOrFinish
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: When parsing "<!" sequences, the code reads in->cur[2] and in->cur[3] to detect "<!--" without ensuring avail >= 4 if terminate is true. If terminate is set and avail is 2 or 3, accessing in->cur[2]/[3] reads past the end of the input buffer.

